l":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"徴税請負制とは何か説明しなさい","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":238},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-998e339ab8bc73c3ba8c-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"integrated","label":"一問一答","prompt":"徴税請負制とは何か説明しなさい","answer":"オスマン帝国で、長期戦による財政難を背景に、国家が一定地域の徴税権を有力者や商人などに請け負わせ、請負人から一定額を納めさせることで現金収入を確保した制度。これが広がると、徴税権と軍役を結びつけていたティマール制が衰退する一因となった。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-633e9b4d034389d934e7","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜第21回 3 オスマン帝国","importanceRank":239,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"ティマール制と徴税請負制の違いを説明しなさい","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":239},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-633e9b4d034389d934e7-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"relation","label":"一問一答","prompt":"ティマール制と徴税請負制の違いを説明しなさい","answer":"ティマール制は徴税権を与える代わりに軍役を課す制度で、徴税請負制は徴税権を与える代わりに国家へ現金を納めさせる制度。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-2b98a561a1ba50be930f","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜第21回 3 オスマン帝国","importanceRank":240,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"1683年、オスマン帝国がウィーン攻略に失敗し、オーストリアやポーランドなどの反撃を受けるきっかけとなった出来事は？","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":240},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-2b98a561a1ba50be930f-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"identify","label":"一問一答","prompt":"1683年、オスマン帝国がウィーン攻略に失敗し、オーストリアやポーランドなどの反撃を受けるきっかけとなった出来事は？","answer":"第2次ウィーン包囲","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-2bbb6b2a7f91fb3bc010","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜第21回 3 オスマン帝国","importanceRank":241,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"第2次ウィーン包囲について説明しなさい","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":241},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-2bbb6b2a7f91fb3bc010-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"integrated","label":"一問一答","prompt":"第2次ウィーン包囲について説明しなさい","answer":"1683年、オスマン帝国がウィーンを包囲したが攻略に失敗し、オーストリアやポーランドなどの反撃を受けた出来事。以後、オスマン帝国はヨーロッパで後退していった。","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-c898fcef8f9211a2d09a","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜第21回 3 オスマン帝国","importanceRank":242,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"1699年、オスマン帝国がオーストリアなどと結び、ハンガリーなどを割譲した条約は？","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":242},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHSO-c898fcef8f9211a2d09a-B01","stage":"beginner","focus":"一問一答","type":"identify","label":"一問一答","prompt":"1699年、オスマン帝国がオーストリアなどと結び、ハンガリーなどを割譲した条約は？","answer":"カルロヴィッツ条約","explanation":"","keywords":[],"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerNote":"","yearMnemonic":"","source":{"name":"利用者作成CSV","url":""},"hideTermUntilAnswer":true}],"reverse":[],"integrated":[]}},{"id":"WHSO-202d2917a99d8326d140","datasetLabel":"世界史SO｜第21回 3 オスマン帝国","importanceRank":243,"difficultyLabel":"一問一答","category":"イスラーム世界","term":"カルロヴィッツ条約について説明しなさい","reading":"","aliases":[],"era":"","geography":{"macroRegion":"","macroRegions":[],"regionDetail":""},"chronology":{"displayPeriod":"","sortYear":243},"stages":{"beginner":[{"id":"WHS